BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF MAGETAN,

Considering: a. that violence against women and children is an act that violates the rights and dignity of women and children as human beings;
b. that efforts to protect women and children victims of violence in the Region have not been optimal, thus requiring institutional strengthening and regulations that can guarantee its implementation in accordance with applicable provisions;
c. that based on Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 Year 2015, women's empowerment and child protection are governmental affairs that must be implemented by Regional Government;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the implementation of protection for women and children victims of violence;

In View of: 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 12 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas Within the Province of East Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1950 Number 41) as amended by Law Number 2 Year 1965 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1965 Number 19, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2730);
